// Ch8 B15 "Captain?" (act1_ch08.md §2 B15; W15 → W16 → W17 → W10 from below). Letterboxed, scripted,
// staged EXACTLY as ADR 0022 (c) pins it. ALL CUTS (no blend=).
// W15, low at the stair foot, 16:40, near-night: the sea in the low town to a man's waist, spray coming
// over the wall in sheets. The last climbers on the bottom flights, backs to camera, FACING THE CLIMB,
// hands on the hand-line rings. Waist-deep at the foot, a big man in a sodden straw cape pushing them up
// one by one: Kerrid, his wrapped LEFT arm toward the lens. NO ROPE-BURN GLOW (ADR 0022 (g)): the only
// light is the storm's cyan high above; no @vfx in this scene.
// W16: Old Marra, of the 1001 stair-watch, the only one who looks back down. CU: rain, disbelief,
// something like hope. W17: Kerrid's face, both eyes clear. One beat, no word, and he goes DOWN a step,
// deeper, back to the people below her. She is pushed on up by the climber behind. No reaction close-up
// after the step. W10 from below: the wall-head far above and tiny, the shield-line fighting in the
// spray. Out of earshot: wind and surf only.
// Rules: no music line on the word (the bed drops to wind before it), no VO, no other climber turns.
// Toma and the Stillguard are never in a shot that also holds the stair foot (W10_below is the far
// wall-head only). Sets ch08_fishwife_called (critical: Ch12, Ch15).
title: ch08_captain
location: ch08/corrow
---
@letterbox on
@music silence fade=1.5
@sfx surf_storm
@camera W15
@anim kerrid push_climber climber_a
@wait 2.0
@camera W16
@anim marra look_back kerrid
@wait 1.5
Marra [surprised]: Captain? #line:ch08_captain_001 #whisper
@camera W17
@wait 1.0
@mark kerrid foot_kerrid_deeper walk
@camera W15
@mark marra foot_marra_up walk
@wait 1.5
@camera W10_below
@wait 2.5
<<set $ch08_fishwife_called = true>>
@letterbox off
===
